{title: Ennulle Ennulle}
{artist: Swarnalatha Ilaiyaraaja}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] Ennulle ennulle,        [Cm] pala minnal ezhum neram
[Cm] engengo engengo,        [Cm] en ennam pogum thooram
naan [Cm] mei maranthu [Fm] maara oor,        [Cm] vaarthai illai [Fm] koora
ethu [Cm] voooo [Fm] oo [Cm] mogam,        [Cm] Kannirendil nooru
[Cm] vennilakkal thondrum,        [Bb] aanaalum anal paayum.. [Eb] ...
[Cm] naadi engum aetho,        [Cm] naatha vellam oodum
[Bb] Aanalum enna thaagam .. [Eb] ..        [Cm] Mei silirkum vannam
[G] thee valarthathenna,        [Cm] Thoobam podum neram
[G] thoondilitathenna,        [F] Ennaiye kettu aenginen [Cm] naan
